{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>HOY新處境劇《你的保安李寶安》日前（26日）首播即傳捷報，最高收視達9.4點，直逼雙位數。劇中飾演畢好彩的「HOY一姐」盧頌恩（妹頭），憑親切形象及十足喜感受到觀眾注意，人氣更隨劇集開播急升。現時身形圓潤、予人福氣滿滿感覺的妹頭，其實當年以𡃁模身份入行，甜美樣貌與修長美腿令人留下深刻印象。她昔日身形窈窕，與如今的形象形成鮮明對。</p><figure><img alt=\"盧頌恩 Aiyana Lo　飾　畢好彩（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261020/1189243737268555776831426.png/2WViDUzQocRlMay_ivFTOx7NrJHblRLyoLvpTqC76U4\"/><figcaption>盧頌恩 Aiyana Lo　飾　畢好彩（YouTube@HOY媒體網絡）</figcaption></figure><p>比堅尼舊照出土 玲瓏浮凸惹熱議</p><p>近日有網民翻出妹頭年輕時的舊照，分享多張比堅尼照片。照片中的她玲瓏浮凸，狀態相當亮眼，引起網民的熱議。隨着新劇收視報捷，加上昔日照片被廣傳，令妹頭在網上的人氣急速攀升。</p><figure><img alt=\"妹頭有一把標誌性嘅短髮。（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613316/org/9ad5dd738553a3f83749fe2b97f11881.jpg/zxqxI6Y3Dbisofv0Ltb-OLAt2-JiL072oIDwdqCA8HY\"/><figcaption>妹頭有一把標誌性嘅短髮。（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613315/org/8ce0285fdca7e9adbe8b34d58e9c0f6b.jpg/1sUee7K65TOkgFcJ_eY_bAdjmSW5-BVkaO0Yc2jtGHM\"/><figcaption>（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613314/org/3ecb72bce685f0910a4ee0a8827b6bcb.jpg/VbX_HK0YqrHLtIx5ULuDFffbHMHIN9LHziEfPc4hHz0\"/><figcaption>（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613318/org/e8999617056a1f570f6da37d370970b3.jpg/IUV_dP3O0ofVuVm8tNlGXiQ0_yeuqICBRv1NO0b9TTs\"/><figcaption>（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613317/org/a87bc9789c99e429a0efc6905754632e.jpg/CvIz5xvRcwLqCGhx86WafSx-14JiCWmwMko3JjJKNyY\"/><figcaption>（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"節目由李尚正和盧頌恩（妹頭）旁白。（Instagram@aiyanalo）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200805/367794234302009344.jpeg/oolEZyFnBXbpISxx8UZj3Nt6-tqMsnODPjZCyj42Qso\"/><figcaption>節目由李尚正和盧頌恩（妹頭）旁白。（Instagram@aiyanalo）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藝人盧頌恩是大會嘉賓之一。（Facebook@妹頭．盧頌恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2748113/org/f28ff9b53ea2810372495a75a26283a6.jpg/VUtLQujLcwOFJ09CTCnETmjilhXanMP6IQSwyiEEsMo\"/><figcaption>藝人盧頌恩是大會嘉賓之一。（Facebook@妹頭．盧頌恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613319/org/1800d5126a2f5828ba91b3e117a6bede.jpg/jIRepSKDFHlrq1jui6pxw_r6KsxNAbZrbddkxW3XZMU\"/><figcaption>（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"佢都十分具備做主持的外表。（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613320/org/8c6b4d3237eb3af6eb86344b1bacae15.jpg/uj4Y8rUme2rBP8uOLWpuzaeg5dCinpgb4g0HNOINBzQ\"/><figcaption>佢都十分具備做主持的外表。（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"身材都唔錯架！（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/613321/org/715899f1295792e7e0ee6932d7d67e12.jpg/oSWcqqb0tDrn6i6h94TtQjSk6VCS1HUhT0uIp09LiKc\"/><figcaption>身材都唔錯架！（妹頭盧頌恩Facebook）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T05:41:45.361422+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":533,"images":11,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T05:30:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T07:18:41.434280+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T05:38:33.577383+00:00","content_hash":"4da83fa07afd14307628ab287776a764003e8303e9eca904ee2c906c091750a2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}